{"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"anchor":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PoseWalkEnrollment\/Frame"],"generated":true,"title":"Structures"},{"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PoseWalkEnrollment\/init()"],"generated":true,"title":"Initializers"},{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PoseWalkEnrollment\/currentTarget","doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PoseWalkEnrollment\/isToppingUp","doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PoseWalkEnrollment\/poseCounts","doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PoseWalkEnrollment\/samplesBanked","doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PoseWalkEnrollment\/skippedPoses"],"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties"},{"anchor":"Instance-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PoseWalkEnrollment\/advance(_:bank:)"],"generated":true,"title":"Instance Methods"},{"anchor":"Type-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PoseWalkEnrollment\/minimumFaceLuma","doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PoseWalkEnrollment\/requiredSamples","doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PoseWalkEnrollment\/samplesPerPose"],"generated":true,"title":"Type Properties"},{"anchor":"Type-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PoseWalkEnrollment\/isTooDark(exposureSaturatedDark:faceLuma:)"],"generated":true,"title":"Type Methods"},{"anchor":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PoseWalkEnrollment\/Pose","doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PoseWalkEnrollment\/Step"],"generated":true,"title":"Enumerations"},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PoseWalkEnrollment\/Equatable-Implementations"],"generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PoseWalkEnrollment"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/QuickStart"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is the full enrolment. The single-frame"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustService\/enroll(name:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" stays available as a quick start; it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"banks one sample."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The recipe is a value you drive once per processed camera frame; it makes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every decision and never touches the camera or the engine itself:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arm: check "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PoseWalkEnrollment\/isTooDark(exposureSaturatedDark:faceLuma:)"},{"type":"text","text":", then bank"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the current frame with "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/YEOFRSDK\/enroll(faceID:name:)"},{"type":"text","text":" while the user"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"faces the camera. On "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".OK"},{"type":"text","text":", create a walk with "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PoseWalkEnrollment\/init()"},{"type":"text","text":" — it counts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that sample as the first "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PoseWalkEnrollment\/Pose\/front"},{"type":"text","text":" sample. The recipe assumes the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"identity was empty before that sample: the engine appends to an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"identity already enrolled under the name, so clear it first"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/YEOFRSDK\/clearTracker()"},{"type":"text","text":"), keeping a copy of the tracker to restore."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each frame after "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustSession\/processFrame(buffer:)"},{"type":"text","text":", read the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"face (pose, dominance, exposure) into a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PoseWalkEnrollment\/Frame"},{"type":"text","text":" and call"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PoseWalkEnrollment\/advance(_:bank:)"},{"type":"text","text":". When the recipe wants a sample it calls "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"bank"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"exactly once: bank the frame the engine just processed (for example"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sdk.enroll(faceID: id, name: name) == .OK"},{"type":"text","text":") and return whether the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"engine took it."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Act on the returned "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PoseWalkEnrollment\/Step"},{"type":"text","text":": coach, show progress, and on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PoseWalkEnrollment\/Step\/completed"},{"type":"text","text":" persist the reference encrypted, with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/YEOFRSDK\/encryptedFaceRecognitionTrackerData()"},{"type":"text","text":" ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":", an empty"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker, is a failure to enrol); on "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PoseWalkEnrollment\/Step\/failed"},{"type":"text","text":" discard the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"capture. The samples it banked are already in the engine: clear the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker or restore the copy kept at arming"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/YEOFRSDK\/loadTracker(from:)-3tg9w"},{"type":"text","text":"), or the next tracker write persists"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the failed walk."}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The walk visits "},{"code":"Pose.allCases","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in order and banks"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PoseWalkEnrollment\/samplesPerPose","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" samples in each, one per unbroken run of 10 matching"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"frames — a pose is held about half a second, not passed on the transient"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"frames of a head moving between poses. A pose that banks nothing for 120"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"frames is skipped. Between pose samples, any frame with a dominant face"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that does not match the target is offered as an extra sample every 10th"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"frame, so the bank fills from the whole walk, but only while the bank"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"has room beyond the pose samples still asked for. When every pose is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"filled or skipped (or after 1500 frames) the walk ends; if fewer than"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PoseWalkEnrollment\/requiredSamples","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" were banked (the arming sample included) the capture"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tops up — one sample every 10th frame with a dominant face — and fails if"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it is still short after 1200 more frames. A too-dark frame freezes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"everything, budgets included, until the light improves."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In the default configuration the engine’s foundation slot keeps the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"first "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PoseWalkEnrollment\/requiredSamples","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" samples it is given, in order, and answers"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":".OK","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for later ones without storing them. The recipe never offers past"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it: extra samples stop once "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PoseWalkEnrollment\/samplesBanked","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" plus the samples still"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"asked for by the poses neither full nor skipped reaches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PoseWalkEnrollment\/requiredSamples","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". So on a slow walk the late poses (chin up, chin"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"down) still get both their samples into the slot, and the capture"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"completes on the offer that fills it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Budgets count calls to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PoseWalkEnrollment\/advance(_:bank:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and are sized for a 20 Hz"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"frame loop: about 75 s for the walk and 60 s for the top-up."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/yeofr\/posewalkenrollment"]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"YEOFR"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PoseWalkEnrollment"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","title":"PoseWalkEnrollment","externalID":"s:5YEOFR18PoseWalkEnrollmentV","symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PoseWalkEnrollment","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"a